  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-electrical\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Electrical Services in Greenville, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Electrical wiring, panel upgrades and replacement, and lighting maintenance from licensed electricians throughout Greenville, SC.</p>\n<p>Whether you need electrical wiring services for a renovation, an electrical panel upgrade to support more power, or routine lighting maintenance, Carolina Heating Service provides licensed electrical services throughout Greenville, SC. Electricians diagnose the actual problem, explain your options, and complete the work safely and up to code.</p>\n<p>Older homes throughout the Greenville area often have electrical panels and wiring that weren&#8217;t built for the number of devices and appliances in a modern household, which shows up as tripped breakers, flickering lights, or a panel that simply can&#8217;t support an upgrade like an <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/car-charger-installation\">EV charger</a>. An electrical panel replacement or upgrade addresses the actual capacity issue instead of managing around it room by room.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: -4px;\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-working-on-an-electrical-circuit-box.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician working on an electrical circuit box\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-gray-light-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /-->\n<div  class=\"services-list container py-5 align-items-left has-background has-gray-light-background-color description-cards align-items-center\" data-layout=\"desc\" data-choose-services=\"subservices\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4 wp-block-heading\">Our Electrical Services in Greenville, SC Services</h2>    <!-- multi-component-container /--><div class=\"has-background multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height multi-component-container--4-up\">\n    <div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/car-charger-installation\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/09/electrical-services-car-charger-installation.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An electric vehicle being charged outside of a personal garage.\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"EV Charger Installation in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"EV Charger Installation in Greenville, SC\">EV Charger Installation in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>Trust us for reliable and efficient car charger installations. We ensure a seamless installation process, from assessing your electrical system to selecting the right charger.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/car-charger-installation\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/outlet-switch-repair-services\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"612\" height=\"408\" src=\"/images/2024/11/outlet-switch-repair-image.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A licensed electrician performing a switch replacement in Greenville, SC\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Switch and Outlet Repair in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Switch and Outlet Repair in Greenville, SC\">Switch and Outlet Repair in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">Are you in need of expert switch and outlet repair services in Greenville, SC? Look no further than Carolina Heating&hellip;</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/outlet-switch-repair-services\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/wiring-rewiring-services\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"/images/2024/10/rewiring-image.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An electrician performing rewiring services at a home in Greenville, SC\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Wiring and Rewiring Services in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Wiring and Rewiring Services in Greenville, SC\">Wiring and Rewiring Services in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">When it comes to reliable wiring and rewiring services in Greenville, SC, Carolina Heating Services stands out as the go-to&hellip;</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/wiring-rewiring-services\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/ceiling-fans\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-ceiling-fan-installed-on-the-ceiling-of-a-homes-room.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A ceiling fan installed on the ceiling of a home’s room\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Ceiling Fan Installation in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Ceiling Fan Installation in Greenville, SC\">Ceiling Fan Installation in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>Our electricians have the expertise to install ceiling fans efficiently and with precision. From wiring to mounting, we ensure a seamless installation. Trust us to bring comfort and style to your home.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/ceiling-fans\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--service has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/circuit-breakers\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-working-on-an-electrical-panel.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician working on an electrical panel\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Circuit Breaker Panel Services in Greenville, SC\" aria-label=\"Circuit Breaker Panel Services in Greenville, SC\">Circuit Breaker Panel Services in Greenville, SC</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>We pride ourselves on precision work, using high-quality materials, and adhering to industry safety standards. Trust us for reliable circuit breaker installation to protect your home or business.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/circuit-breakers\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outlined\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n    </div><!-- ./multi-component-container -->\n</div><!-- ./container -->\n<!-- container /--><div  class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">What Electrical Service Involves</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Electrical service covers everything from a single <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/outlet-switch-repair-services\">outlet</a> repair to a full panel replacement, and the right scope depends on what&#8217;s actually going on with your system. Electrical wiring services address problems inside walls and ceilings, while an electrical panel handles how power is distributed to every circuit in your home, so panel issues tend to affect multiple rooms at once. Carolina Heating Service provides:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Electrical wiring and <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/wiring-rewiring-services\">rewiring</a> services for renovations, repairs, and older homes</li>\n<li>Electrical panel upgrades and replacement for added capacity and safety</li>\n<li>Electrical lighting maintenance and repair for fixtures, switches, and outlets</li>\n<li>Specialty electrical services including EV charger installation, <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/ceiling-fans\">ceiling fans</a>, and <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-electrical/circuit-breakers\">circuit breakers</a></li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Signs You Need an Electrical Panel Upgrade or Replacement</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Frequently tripped breakers, flickering or dimming lights when appliances turn on, warm or discolored outlets, and a panel that&#8217;s more than 20 to 25 years old are all signs it&#8217;s time for an inspection. If you&#8217;re planning an addition, a major appliance upgrade, or an EV charger installation, checking whether your panel has enough capacity before you commit to the upgrade can save you from a bigger problem later.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Why Choose Carolina Heating Service for Electrical Services in Greenville, SC</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Carolina Heating Service has provided electrical wiring, panel, and lighting services across Greenville, SC and the Upstate for years.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Licensed electricians: Every job is performed by a trained, licensed professional.</li>\n<li>Safety and code compliance: Work is completed to meet local electrical codes, not just to get the lights back on.</li>\n<li>Trained on major manufacturer brands and models: From wiring to panel replacement, our team is trained to service the equipment already in your home.</li>\n<li>Transparent, customer-focused service: Clear explanations and honest recommendations, not upsells.</li>\n<li>Online scheduling and 24/7 chat: Request service anytime through the Carolina Heating Service website, even outside office hours.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Our Electrical Service Process</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <ul>\n<li>Contact: Call, chat or schedule online. Same-day appointments are available.</li>\n<li>Inspection: A licensed electrician diagnoses the issue or evaluates your panel and wiring.</li>\n<li>Recommendation: You get a clear explanation of the repair, upgrade, or replacement option, with pricing, before work begins.</li>\n<li>Work: Service is completed by a licensed electrician, up to code.</li>\n<li>Follow-up: Get recommendations for future capacity needs as your household&#8217;s electrical use changes.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --><!-- buttons/ -->\n        <div class=\"justify-content-center wp-block-group mt-4 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(864) 362-6329</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a></div><!-- ./buttons -->\n     </div><!-- ./container -->\n\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 15;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:15;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Amana Heating &amp; Air Conditio