ements-5\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-3\">Qualified for All Major Makes and Models</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"wp-block-group flow mb-2 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n    <p>Our team of expert technicians is trained to handle all makes and models of major brands with precision and care. From routine maintenance to complex repairs, we ensure top-notch service for all.</p>\n\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Ensure optimal efficiency of all your systems</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Lower your utility costs with energy efficiency</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Extend your system’s lifespan through regular maintenance</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Keep you and your family comfortable and safe during all seasons</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div class=\"our-promise container my-5 mt-m-0\" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-doing-an-electrical-test.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician doing an electrical test\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Licensed Electricians Providing Electrical Services in Greenville and the Upstate of South Carolina</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At Carolina Heating Service, we promise excellence through our skilled technicians, quality workmanship, and unwavering dedication to your satisfaction. Our experienced team is committed to delivering reliable solutions that not only meet your needs but also exceed your expectations. From HVAC installations and repairs to plumbing and electrical services, we take pride in our meticulous attention to detail and superior service. You can trust us to provide peace of mind, knowing that your home is in capable hands. Choose Carolina Heating Service for all your comfort needs and experience the exceptional quality and reliability that sets us apart!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"maintenance-financing\" class=\"container splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2468f3b8 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized has-custom-border w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-performing-maintenance.jpg\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician performing maintenance\" class=\"wp-image-4845\" style=\"border-radius:0px;width:288px;height:auto\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Need a Maintenance Plan?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive With the Carolina Comfort Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-8\">\n<li>15% Off Repair</li>\n\n<li>Heating &amp; Cooling Tune-Up</li>\n\n<li>Reduced Dispatch Fees</li>\n\n<li>Priority Service</li>\n\n<li>Save More with Loyalty Points</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1802\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-employee-smiling-while-sitting-at-a-desk-and-working-on-their-computer.jpg\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service employee smiling while sitting at a desk and working on their computer\" class=\"wp-image-4837\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3\">Ask Us About Financing!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 wp-block-paragraph\">Financing plans bring value and benefits to homeowners. By opting for a financing option, you can tackle necessary repairs or upgrades without draining your savings or delaying important projects. Here are some key advantages:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"my-0 mb-0 wp-block-list\">\n<li>Budget-Friendly</li>\n\n<li>Access to Quality Services</li>\n\n<li>Timely Repairs</li>\n\n<li>Flexibility</li>\n\n<li>Increase Home Value</li>\n\n<li>Emergency Protection</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"mt-3 wp-block-paragraph\">Keep your home safe and comfortable with a finance plan. Always assess terms and interest rates to find the best one for your needs. A professional can help you make an informed decision.</p>\n\n<a href=\"/financing\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-cent